{"3482000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bounce IT", "steam_appid": 3482000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce It</strong> is a fast-paced arcade game built around one core rule:<br><strong>Keep the ball bouncing from side to side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bounce keeps you in the game. Time your inputs well to maintain the rhythm and stay on track. Across every game mode, the challenge is to keep the motion going while adapting to new patterns, obstacles, and setups. Score higher, survive longer, and unlock new content as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience by completing levels and improving your score. As you level up, you’ll unlock  skin tokens to get skins and visual effects to personalize your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Bounce Mechanic</strong><br>A satisfying side-to-side bounce that defines every mode and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Through Play</strong><br>Gain experience by reaching milestones, and improving your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Skins</strong><br>Customize your ball, bouncer, particles, trail and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Score Runs</strong><br>Push your skills to the limit in endless modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Visuals with Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Clean, readable presentation designed to keep you immersed and in control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce It is my first experimental Steam project, created mainly as a way to learn and grow as a developer..</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce It</strong> is a fast-paced arcade game built around one core rule:<br><strong>Keep the ball bouncing from side to side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bounce keeps you in the game. Time your inputs well to maintain the rhythm and stay on track. Across every game mode, the challenge is to keep the motion going while adapting to new patterns, obstacles, and setups. Score higher, survive longer, and unlock new content as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience by completing levels and improving your score. As you level up, you’ll unlock  skin tokens to get skins and visual effects to personalize your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Bounce Mechanic</strong><br>A satisfying side-to-side bounce that defines every mode and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Through Play</strong><br>Gain experience by reaching milestones, and improving your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Skins</strong><br>Customize your ball, bouncer, particles, trail and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Score Runs</strong><br>Push your skills to the limit in endless modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Visuals with Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Clean, readable presentation designed to keep you immersed and in control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Note</strong></h2><p